   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This indicator covers direct Southern partners. These are organisations with a contractual relationship with the project or organisations funded through the project. This only pertains to Southern-based organisations funded or supported within the current Strategic Partnership Agreement period between 2022 and 2025.
